  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improved governance of national social security system</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Since 2018, ILO has been supporting the Hellenic Statistical Authority (ELSTAT) in preparing statistical information on social insurance pension schemes to be reported to EUROSTAT.  Such reporting has to be done every 3 years.  This reporting requires the implication of the National Actuarial Authority (NAA).
An ongoing project in partnership with ELSTAT aims to improve national accounts statistical disclosure with respect to the social insurance pension benefits.</narrative>
  </description>
